{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Defines the look and feel the tab bar must have by applying the OUDS tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Changes only colors and typgraphies, and does not add additional items like indicator of selected tab or divider."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To use these elements in your tab view, use instead "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTabBarViewModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Rendering","text":"Rendering"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS 26 brings Liquid Glass, the new Apple look and feel which will prevent developers to define specific styles for some critical components like bars."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because today the OUDS tab bar relies on native component and is not designed from scratch, some elements will look different between iOS 26 and older versions:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"background color of tab bar can be changed for iOS lower than 26"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[